{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tune in to the show Part 2</i></strong>\u00a0follows the story of <strong><i>Tune in to the show</i></strong>. It features in-game days 16 to 23 and continues the story of the protagonist and their romantic/lewd adventures in the bizarre house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e13902e1cea80e08031b310a1cc6cc4c.poster.avif?t=1760190767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e13902e1cea80e08031b310a1cc6cc4c.webm?t=1760190767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e13902e1cea80e08031b310a1cc6cc4c.mp4?t=1760190767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's heavily recommended that you play the original first to understand the story and the characters. The game features choices that both change the dialogue and let you choose which of the characters you want to romance (and have sex with). This is a harem story by default, but you can reject any love interests that you aren't interested in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c6786885df1f0be005525e34f2d9850c.poster.avif?t=1760190767\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c6786885df1f0be005525e34f2d9850c.webm?t=1760190767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c6786885df1f0be005525e34f2d9850c.mp4?t=1760190767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa